  "register_rules": [
    "No fixture-backed receipt may mint a class value outside this taxonomy without changing this file and the matching schema/example/scenario fixtures in the same revision.",
    "Free-form prose may explain a class but may not silently redefine it.",
    "Promotion, frozen-head, current-active, and stronger workspace-wide claims must fail closed when a required class or gate is missing.",
    "Any stronger share/current/frozen exception must live in an expiring waiver ledger; a waiver without owner/reviewer identity, status, and expiry is incomplete.",
    "Projected, derived, quarantined, promoted, or superseded artifacts are incomplete until produced-by receipt refs and lineage links move with their schemas/examples/scenarios.",
    "Same-scope competing artifacts are incomplete until contradiction packets, arbitration classes, review-queue posture, and blocked stronger-use rules move with the matching schemas/examples/scenarios.",
    "Fixture-backed Cargo Report Kit revisions are incomplete until the machine-checked contract-hygiene surface confirms taxonomy, scenarios, review gates, and example/schema pairs still agree.",
    "Manual-review carries are incomplete until the review request, the consulted basis, the requested stronger use, and the resulting decision witness move as first-class artifacts instead of collapsing into one status label.",
    "Manual-review carries that clear stronger public/current/frozen/contradiction reuse are incomplete until a review-separation receipt says whether the carry cleared an independent checker, a weaker same-team second look, or only a compensating fallback control with expiry."
